.TH MYRIAD 1 "2026-11-27" "myriad 0.1.0" "Spectacle Line Manual"
.SH NAME
myriad \- branching multi-agent investigation map, atlas, and temporal lineage reader
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmyriad\fR [\fB-h\fR | \fB--help\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR \fIFILE\fR ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmyriad\fR reads version 1 logs of branching investigations (explorations), multi-question collections (atlases), and chronological chains of atlases (lineages). It validates tree structure and cycle freedom, tracks open, taken, and abandoned branches alongside worker dibs claims, and prints twenty-one deterministic offline readings without ever declaring a winner.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBmap <exploration.json>\fR
Render the indented tree of open, taken, and abandoned branches.
.TP
\fBcheck <exploration.json>\fR
Validate an exploration and print branch state counts or every structural defect.
.TP
\fBclaims | census <exploration.json>\fR
Tally or group branches by worker dibs claim label.
.TP
\fBatlas | index <atlas.json>\fR
Render a full multi-question atlas or its question summary index.
.TP
\fBchangelog <before_atlas.json> <after_atlas.json>\fR
Diff structural branch and state changes between two atlases.
.TP
\fBlineage | returns | standing | absence | arrivals | departures | matched | runs | presence | standings | company | sets | rosters | fellows <lineage.json>\fR
Run the fourteen longitudinal chain readings across a chronological atlas lineage.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fR
Valid exploration, atlas, or lineage confirmed and printed cleanly.
.TP
\fB1\fR
Malformed input refused with structured defect lines on stdout, or closed stdout write when 8192 or more bytes sit buffered.
.TP
\fB2\fR
Unknown subcommand, unrecognized option, or wrong file argument count on stderr.
.TP
\fB120\fR
Failed stderr stream write, or closed stdout write when 4096 or fewer bytes sit buffered.
.SH EXAMPLES
Validate an exploration log
.nf
.RS 4
myriad check examples/winter-ferry.json
.RE
.fi
.PP
Render a branching investigation map
.nf
.RS 4
myriad map examples/winter-ferry.json
.RE
.fi
.PP
Inspect longitudinal entry standing across a lineage
.nf
.RS 4
myriad standing examples/winter-spring-summer-lineage.json
.RE
.fi
